.SS "int ev_send_append (char ** mp, int * lp, char * dp)"
.PP
append string to that in send-buffer. 
.PP
each string thus appended will have a 3-byte header (1 byte type ('s'), 2 bytes length (network order)). 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
an error-code 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fImp\fP the send buffer (address may change due to realloc()) 
.br
\fIlp\fP current number of bytes in send-buffer (will be updated) 
.br
\fIdp\fP data to append
.RE
.PP

